      "clip_end": "00:02:00.0",
      "narration": "We open in a half-underground flat in Seoul, where the Kim family lives at street level with the gutter. Ki-woo lifts his phone to the ceiling, hunting for a sliver of a neighbour's wi-fi.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "setup",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Ki-woo"
