      "clip_start": "00:03:55.0",
      "clip_end": "00:04:02.0",
      "narration": "They fold pizza boxes for small change, the whole family crammed elbow to elbow, and even that work they manage to do badly.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "setup",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Ki-taek"
      }
    },
    {
