      "clip_start": "00:06:00.0",
      "clip_end": "00:06:11.0",
      "narration": "When the street outside is fumigated, the father tells them to leave the windows wide open - free pest control, if they can stand the choking cloud. They are too broke to be proud about anything.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "setup",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Ki-taek"
      }
    },
    {
