      "clip_end": "00:11:35.0",
      "narration": "There is just one small snag: Ki-woo never actually finished university. So his sister Ki-jung sits down at the laptop and forges him a flawless enrolment certificate in minutes. In this household, deception is the one true family trade.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "action",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Ki-jung"
