      "clip_start": "00:18:30.0",
      "clip_end": "00:18:42.0",
      "narration": "And he hears Mrs Park confide that she is desperate - she cannot find a single art teacher able to handle her wild, troubled son. It is exactly the opening Ki-woo was waiting for.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "dialogue",
        "requires_visual": true,
