      "clip_start": "00:19:55.0",
      "clip_end": "00:20:07.0",
      "narration": "So Ki-woo recommends a brilliant, impossibly hard-to-book art therapist named Jessica - who is secretly his own sister, Ki-jung. The two of them will look each other in the eye and pretend to be complete strangers who have never met.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "action",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Ki-woo"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "line_id": "L17",
      "unit_id": "U05",
      "covers": [
        "5"
      ],
      "clip_start": "00:26:40.0",
      "clip_end": "00:26:52.0",
      "narration": "Ki-jung sweeps in and improvises an avalanche of impressive, invented art-therapy jargon about the boy's hidden trauma, his secret darkness, the black box buried deep inside his childish drawings. The completely dazzled mother hires her at a premium on the spot.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "dialogue",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Ki-jung"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "line_id": "L18",
      "unit_id": "U06",
      "covers": [
        "6"
      ],
      "clip_start": "00:29:00.0",
      "clip_end": "00:29:03.0",
      "narration": "Next they come for the chauffeur.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "setup",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Ki-jung"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "line_id": "L19",
      "unit_id": "U06",
      "covers": [
        "6"
      ],
      "clip_start": "00:29:30.0",
      "clip_end": "00:29:42.0",
      "narration": "And on the way, she quietly slips a pair of her own underwear down beneath the back seat of his spotless company car, a tiny lie waiting to be found.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "setup",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Ki-jung"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "line_id": "L20",
      "unit_id": "U06",
      "covers": [
        "6"
      ],
      "clip_start": "00:32:35.0",
      "clip_end": "00:32:47.0",
      "narration": "The Parks find it, assume their young chauffeur has been having sex in the company car, and fire him in disgust - which lets Ki-woo gently suggest a replacement: his own father.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "reveal",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Dong-ik"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "line_id": "L21",
      "unit_id": "U06",
      "covers": [
