      ],
      "clip_start": "00:42:30.0",
      "clip_end": "00:42:40.0",
      "narration": "So they secretly dust peach fuzz onto her behind her back, trigger a violent coughing fit, and then carefully stage the whole thing - bloody tissues and all - to make the terrified Parks believe she has tuberculosis.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "action",
        "requires_visual": true,
