      "clip_start": "00:44:40.0",
      "clip_end": "00:44:52.0",
      "narration": "Terrified their housekeeper is contagious, the Parks let her go without a second thought. The con is complete. All four Kims now work inside the house, drawing four good salaries, while still pretending to be unrelated strangers.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "dialogue",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Ki-taek"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "line_id": "L25",
      "unit_id": "U06",
      "covers": [
        "8"
      ],
      "clip_start": "00:51:30.0",
      "clip_end": "00:51:42.0",
      "narration": "Father, mother, son and daughter - all four of them now move through the same house every single day, addressing one another as polite strangers. A single family wearing four separate disguises, quietly feeding off one rich household.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "reveal",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Ki-taek"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "line_id": "L26",
      "unit_id": "U07",
      "covers": [
        "9"
      ],
      "clip_start": "00:53:35.0",
      "clip_end": "00:53:47.0",
      "narration": "Their golden moment finally arrives when the entire Park family packs up and heads off on a birthday camping trip for the boy, leaving the great glass house completely, gloriously empty behind them.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "transition",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Yeon-kyo"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "line_id": "L27",
      "unit_id": "U07",
      "covers": [
        "9"
      ],
      "clip_start": "00:56:40.0",
      "clip_end": "00:56:52.0",
      "narration": "The Kims move in like the owners they pretend to be - sprawling across the vast living room, soaking in the marble bath, drinking the Parks' expensive whiskey as the rain falls softly on the perfect garden outside.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "emotion",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Ki-taek"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "line_id": "L28",
      "unit_id": "U07",
      "covers": [
        "10"
      ],
      "clip_start": "01:00:50.0",
      "clip_end": "01:01:02.0",
      "narration": "For one drunken night they let themselves believe the house is theirs. The lady is so nice, one says - and the mother answers that she is nice because she is rich. Money, she says, is an iron that smooths out every crease.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "dialogue",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Ki-taek"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "line_id": "L29",
      "unit_id": "U08",
      "covers": [
        "11"
      ],
      "clip_start": "01:03:00.0",
      "clip_end": "01:03:12.0",
      "narration": "And then, late that night, the doorbell rings. Standing out in the pouring rain is Moon-gwang, the old housekeeper they schemed to get fired, desperately begging to be let inside just for a moment - she says she left something important behind, down in the basement.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "reveal",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Moon-gwang"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "line_id": "L30",
      "unit_id": "U09",
      "covers": [
        "12"
      ],
      "clip_start": "01:05:00.0",
      "clip_end": "01:05:12.0",
      "narration": "She hurries down to the cellar and drags aside a heavy storage shelf. And behind it is a door that no one in this family was ever meant to find - and a narrow staircase plunging straight down into the dark.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "discovery",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Moon-gwang"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "line_id": "L31",
      "unit_id": "U10",
      "covers": [
        "12"
      ],
      "clip_start": "01:06:25.0",
      "clip_end": "01:06:37.0",
      "narration": "Moon-gwang vanishes down the hidden stair into the black. A baffled Chung-sook grabs a phone for light and follows her down, with no idea what is waiting at the bottom.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "transition",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Moon-gwang"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "line_id": "L32",
      "unit_id": "U10",
      "covers": [
        "13"
      ],
      "clip_start": "01:07:00.0",
      "clip_end": "01:07:12.0",
      "narration": "Deep beneath the beautiful house, hidden behind that door, lies a secret bunker the architect built and never told anyone about. And living down in it, in the dark, for years, has been Moon-gwang's own husband.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "reveal",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Geun-sae"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "line_id": "L33",
      "unit_id": "U10",
      "covers": [
        "13"
      ],
      "clip_start": "01:08:30.0",
      "clip_end": "01:08:42.0",
      "narration": "His name is Geun-sae. Hiding from loan sharks who would kill him, he has survived down here in secret for years, fed scraps by his wife, quietly worshipping the rich man upstairs who never knew he existed.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "emotion",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Geun-sae"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "line_id": "L34",
      "unit_id": "U10",
      "covers": [
        "13"
      ],
      "clip_start": "01:09:50.0",
      "clip_end": "01:10:02.0",
      "narration": "He eats alone in the gloom beside a panel of blinking lights - a man who has somehow made a home out of a tomb. The Kims, it turns out, are not the only parasites in this house.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "reveal",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Geun-sae"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "line_id": "L35",
      "unit_id": "U11",
      "covers": [
        "14"
      ],
      "clip_start": "01:11:00.0",
      "clip_end": "01:11:12.0",
      "narration": "The two desperate poor families collide in that cellar - and it gets ugly. Moon-gwang films the Kims on her phone and threatens to send the proof straight to Mrs Park. In an instant, the con artists are the ones being blackmailed.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "action",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Moon-gwang"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "line_id": "L36",
      "unit_id": "U11",
      "covers": [
        "14"
      ],
      "clip_start": "01:12:30.0",
      "clip_end": "01:12:42.0",
      "narration": "It becomes a frantic scramble for that phone - two families who have nothing left, clawing and wrestling on the cellar floor over the one secret that could ruin them both. There is no solidarity at the bottom; only desperation.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "action",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Geun-sae"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "line_id": "L37",
      "unit_id": "U12",
      "covers": [
        "15"
      ],
      "clip_start": "01:15:50.0",
      "clip_end": "01:16:02.0",
      "narration": "Then comes the worst possible phone call. The very same rain has flooded the campsite, the trip is cancelled, and Mrs Park cheerfully announces the whole family will be pulling up to the house in just eight minutes.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "dialogue",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Chung-sook"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "line_id": "L38",
      "unit_id": "U12",
      "covers": [
        "16"
      ],
      "clip_start": "01:17:15.0",
      "clip_end": "01:17:25.0",
      "narration": "Sudden panic. The Kims overpower Moon-gwang and her husband, drag them back down the stairs into the bunker, and then tear frantically through the house, scrubbing away every last trace that they were ever there.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "action",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Ki-taek"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "line_id": "L39",
      "unit_id": "U12",
      "covers": [
        "17"
      ],
      "clip_start": "01:20:00.0",
      "clip_end": "01:20:09.0",
      "narration": "The Parks arrive before they can escape. Ki-taek, Ki-woo and Ki-jung dive under the low living-room table and freeze, trapped, as the unsuspecting family settles onto the couch just above their heads.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "action",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Ki-taek"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "line_id": "L40",
      "unit_id": "U12",
      "covers": [
        "17"
      ],
      "clip_start": "01:21:30.0",
      "clip_end": "01:21:38.0",
      "narration": "They have to lie absolutely still for hours, holding their breath in the dark, forced to listen to the rich couple's intimate pillow talk just inches away.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "emotion",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Ki-taek"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "line_id": "L41",
      "unit_id": "U13",
      "covers": [
        "18"
      ],
      "clip_start": "01:27:30.0",
      "clip_end": "01:27:42.0",
      "narration": "And there, pinned to the floor just inches away, they overhear Mr Park talking quietly about Ki-taek - about his smell. That particular odour, he says, of people who ride the subway. A smell that creeps up on you and crosses the line.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "dialogue",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Dong-ik"
      }
    },
    {
