      "clip_end": "01:31:43.0",
      "narration": "When the house finally sleeps, the three of them creep out into the storm and begin the long journey down - stairway after stairway, tunnel after tunnel, descending out of the heights of the rich and back down into the gutter where the city has decided they belong.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "transition",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Ki-taek"
      }
