      ],
      "clip_start": "01:35:00.0",
      "clip_end": "01:35:13.0",
      "narration": "They arrive at a neighbourhood drowning in filthy brown water. The very same rain that was a pleasant patter on the Parks' lawn up on the hill is, down here at the bottom of the city, a slow-motion disaster swallowing whole streets.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "setup",
        "requires_visual": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "line_id": "L46",
      "unit_id": "U15",
      "covers": [
        "20"
      ],
      "clip_start": "01:36:30.0",
      "clip_end": "01:36:43.0",
      "narration": "Sewage erupts up out of their toilet; everything the family owns is ruined in minutes. Ki-jung climbs up and perches on the overflowing bowl to light a cigarette, far too exhausted to even be horrified by it anymore.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "reveal",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Ki-jung"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "line_id": "L47",
      "unit_id": "U15",
      "covers": [
        "20"
      ],
      "clip_start": "01:39:30.0",
      "clip_end": "01:39:43.0",
      "narration": "That night they sleep on the floor of a packed emergency gymnasium - just three more anonymous bodies among the hundreds the same storm washed out of their homes - while up on the hill, the Parks sleep dry, warm, and completely untouched by any of it.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "emotion",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Ki-taek"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "line_id": "L48",
      "unit_id": "U16",
      "covers": [
        "21"
      ],
      "clip_start": "01:43:00.0",
      "clip_end": "01:43:10.0",
      "narration": "The very next morning, Mrs Park - utterly delighted by the clear blue skies the same storm has left behind - decides on a cheerful whim to throw a last-minute garden party for her son.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "setup",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Yeon-kyo"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "line_id": "L49",
      "unit_id": "U16",
      "covers": [
        "21"
      ],
      "clip_start": "01:46:00.0",
      "clip_end": "01:46:12.0",
      "narration": "And so the exhausted Kims are summoned straight from the gymnasium floor to wait on the wealthy at play, plastering on smiles to serve canapes to a laughing crowd - in the very garden sitting directly on top of the family's buried secret.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "setup",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Ki-taek"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "line_id": "L50",
      "unit_id": "U16",
      "covers": [
        "22"
      ],
      "clip_start": "01:52:05.0",
      "clip_end": "01:52:11.0",
      "narration": "Ki-jung carries the birthday cake out across the lawn.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "action",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Ki-jung"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "line_id": "L51",
      "unit_id": "U17",
      "covers": [
        "23"
      ],
      "clip_start": "01:51:00.0",
      "clip_end": "01:51:06.0",
      "narration": "But far below, Geun-sae - broken by his wife's death - climbs the bunker stairs toward the light.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "action",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Geun-sae"
      },
      "narrative_jump": true
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "line_id": "L52",
      "unit_id": "U17",
      "covers": [
        "23"
      ],
      "clip_start": "01:53:18.0",
      "clip_end": "01:53:23.0",
      "narration": "And the bunker erupts. He bursts into the daylight and stabs Ki-jung.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "action",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Geun-sae"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "line_id": "L53",
      "unit_id": "U17",
      "covers": [
        "23"
      ],
      "clip_start": "01:53:55.0",
      "clip_end": "01:53:57.0",
      "narration": "She goes down on the grass, bleeding.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "reveal",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Ki-jung"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "line_id": "L54",
      "unit_id": "U17",
      "covers": [
        "23"
      ],
      "clip_start": "01:54:10.0",
      "clip_end": "01:54:19.0",
      "narration": "The elegant garden party collapses into blood and screaming chaos; the little boy faints clean away at the sight, and Ki-taek's wife throws herself at the intruder and wrestles him down onto the lawn.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "reveal",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Geun-sae"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "line_id": "L55",
      "unit_id": "U18",
      "covers": [
        "24"
      ],
      "clip_start": "01:54:40.0",
      "clip_end": "01:54:48.0",
      "narration": "Then Mr Park recoils from the dying man's smell - and that flinch is the line crossed one last time. Something breaks, and Ki-taek kills him.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "action",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Ki-taek"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "line_id": "L56",
      "unit_id": "U18",
      "covers": [
        "25"
      ],
      "clip_start": "01:55:30.0",
      "clip_end": "01:55:42.0",
      "narration": "When the screaming finally stops, the bright sunny garden is left a scene of carnage - and in the panic and the running crowd, Ki-taek has simply, completely vanished.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "reveal",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Ki-woo"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "line_id": "L57",
      "unit_id": "U18",
      "covers": [
        "25"
      ],
      "clip_start": "01:56:30.0",
      "clip_end": "01:56:35.0",
      "narration": "His daughter dead, his son near death - the family destroyed in one bright afternoon.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "reveal",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Ki-woo"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "line_id": "L58",
      "unit_id": "U19",
      "covers": [
        "26"
      ],
      "clip_start": "01:57:00.0",
      "clip_end": "01:57:06.0",
      "narration": "Ki-woo survives, but the head wound leaves him laughing helplessly at nothing, and he and his mother are led away under guard.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "transition",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Ki-woo"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "line_id": "L59",
      "unit_id": "U19",
      "covers": [
        "26"
      ],
      "clip_start": "01:59:20.0",
      "clip_end": "01:59:33.0",
      "narration": "Weeks later, the two survivors are convicted of fraud and put on probation. The Parks have moved out of the cursed house, a German family has moved in, and Ki-woo's father remains missing - simply, completely gone.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "transition",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Ki-woo"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "line_id": "L60",
      "unit_id": "U19",
      "covers": [
        "26"
      ],
      "clip_start": "02:00:00.0",
      "clip_end": "02:00:13.0",
      "narration": "Quieter now, and badly scarred, Ki-woo keeps climbing back up to a hillside above the old house, again and again, just to watch it from a distance and search for any sign of the father who disappeared.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "emotion",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Ki-woo"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "line_id": "L61",
      "unit_id": "U19",
      "covers": [
        "26"
      ],
      "clip_start": "02:00:30.0",
      "clip_end": "02:00:33.0",
      "narration": "He drifts through the cold city, emptier now.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "emotion",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Ki-woo"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "line_id": "L62",
      "unit_id": "U19",
      "covers": [
        "27"
      ],
      "clip_start": "01:59:05.0",
      "clip_end": "01:59:15.0",
      "narration": "And one cold night he sees it - the lights of the house flickering on and off in Morse code. He reads them, and understands: his father never escaped at all.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "discovery",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Ki-woo"
      },
      "narrative_jump": true
    },
    {
      "id": 63,
      "line_id": "L63",
      "unit_id": "U19",
      "covers": [
        "28"
      ],
      "clip_start": "02:01:30.0",
      "clip_end": "02:01:42.0",
      "narration": "His father has taken Geun-sae's place, hiding in that same bunker beneath a brand-new family who has no idea he is there. So Ki-woo pours everything into a letter back.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "reveal",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Ki-woo"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 64,
      "line_id": "L64",
      "unit_id": "U20",
      "covers": [
        "28"
      ],
      "clip_start": "02:05:40.0",
      "clip_end": "02:05:53.0",
      "narration": "So Ki-woo writes his father a letter, and he makes a plan. He will study, and work, and earn a great deal of money, and one day he will simply buy that house - so that his father can walk up out of the dark and into the sun.",
      "claim": {
        "type": "reveal",
        "requires_visual": true,
        "subject": "Ki-woo"
      },
      "narrative_jump": true
